diff --git a/docs/api/sections/notifications.md b/docs/api/sections/notifications.md
index 6bddff1..92e1132 100644
--- a/docs/api/sections/notifications.md
+++ b/docs/api/sections/notifications.md
@@ -96,3 +96,37 @@ __Request:__
 __Response:__
 
 Returns `204 No Content` on success.
+
+## `POST /:account_slug/users/:user_id/push_subscriptions`
+
+Registers a web push subscription for the current user's device.
+
+| Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
+|-----------|------|----------|-------------|
+| `endpoint` | string | Yes | The endpoint from the browser's push subscription |
+| `p256dh_key` | string | Yes | The subscription's public key |
+| `auth_key` | string | Yes | The subscription's auth secret |
+
+__Request:__
+
+```json
+{
+  "push_subscription": {
+    "endpoint": "https://push.example.com/subscription",
+    "p256dh_key": "p256dh-key",
+    "auth_key": "auth-key"
+  }
+}
+```
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `201 Created` on success.
+
+## `DELETE /:account_slug/users/:user_id/push_subscriptions/:id`
+
+Removes a web push subscription. You can also `DELETE /:account_slug/users/:user_id/push_subscriptions?endpoint=...`.
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `204 No Content` on success.
